post.description:
The mail (in the language of `Accept-Language`) carries a token valid 24 hours;
confirm it with `POST /api/v1/auth/email-verification/confirm`. At most one mail
per minute per address.

delete.description:
Signed in with a password session only. Its refresh token stops working at once;
an access token already issued to it keeps working until it expires (15 minutes by
default).
